  "title": "Don’t play the waiting game, the opportunities for Nordic insurers are here now",
  "summary": "As with elsewhere in the world, across the Nordic region, we have seen how geopolitical events and the consequent effects on international markets have affected the insurance industry. Concerns around rising interest rates and costs continue to affect market dynamics. This pressure now sits alongside the need to innovate, improve efficiency, and provide products that respond to evolving customer needs. So, what can insurers in the Nordic region do to mitigate the impact of these changes, and how can they still be open to new opportunities in the industry?",
